{"sentences":[{"en":"The plural form of 'person' is 'people', not 'persons'.","zh":"‘person’ 的复数形式是 'people'，不是 'persons'."},{"en":"The plural of \"Nebelbank\" is \"Nebelbänke\", not \"Nebelbanken\".","zh":"'Nebelbank' 的复数形式是 'Nebelbänke'，而不是 'Nebelbanken'."},{"en":"Plurals aren't as easy in Berber as they are in English.","zh":"柏柏尔语中的复数不像英语中那样容易。"}],"phrases":[{"en":"plural is formed","zh":"构成复数"},{"en":"plural form","zh":"复数形式"},{"en":"plural of horse","zh":"马的复数"}],"senses":[{"pos":"n.","zh":"复数, 复数形式 -"},{"pos":"adj.","zh":"复数的 - 不止一个"}]}
